<title>SPAIN: ENCE makes second quarter loss.</title>
<headline>ENCE makes second quarter loss.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish paper firm ENCE (Empresa Nacional de Celulosas SA) said it made a second quarter 1996 net loss of 1.343 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>This was the result of falling paper prices worldwide, it said, but prices had recovered some ground in June and July.</p>
<p>It gave no further figures and spokesmen were not available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1  585 2151</p>
